Comments:       The FreeRADIUS Server Project is a high performance
                and highly configurable multi-protocol policy server, supporting
                RADIUS, DHCPv4 DHCPv6, DNS, TACACS+ and VMPS. It is
                available under the terms of the GNU GPLv2. Using RADIUS
                allows authentication and authorization for a network to be
                centralized, and minimizes the number of changes that have
                to be done when adding or deleting new users to a network.

                Compiled from source for CP64 16.x.

